{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw \"project/work/evidence/JG-035-opening-drafting-table/manufacturing-implementation-2026-10-05/reduced-motion-independent-review-glm-spec.md\"'","aggregated_output":"OBJECTIVE\nFresh read-only review of the small reduced-motion mounting change against Mark's explicit posters-throughout decision. Requested GLM-5.3-Flash/low. This supplements the parent OpenAI diff review/browser executions and the recorded GLM substitution for unavailable Fable (429); it cannot claim a Fable verdict.\n\nFILES\nOwn only reduced-motion-posters-independent-review.md in this packet. Read src/App.tsx, src/components/StaticPoster.tsx, src/state/qualityStore.ts, reduced-motion-owner-decision-2026-10-06.md, reduced-motion-posters-glm-report.md and new runtime/lifecycle/posters-policy-parent/report.json when present. If the report is incomplete, label browser acceptance pending, not failed. No GPU/browser/build/test commands.\n\nINTERFACES\nVerify initial reduced-mode lazy SceneCanvas/ScrollRig/BootSequence/QuietMachinePreview exclusion; native DOM Chapters/StationNav and static RingInspection availability; truthful poster reason; ordinary full/lite quality ladder unchanged. Check eager DOM imports don't fetch CAD. Explain cold reduced startup versus preference switching after assets already loaded: the latter cannot erase past requests and cached GLTF data may remain. Review actual changed source, not prose alone. Graph exact-file coverage then direct read fallback. No broad architecture exploration; this spec is complete, skip queue docs.\n\nCONSTRAINTS\nYou are not alone. No source edits, staging/commit/push/deploy or memory writes. Preserve original narrative/ladder and immutable CAD. Parent source tests445/43 and build703 PASS (posters-policy logs); source changes3files plus two doc comments. No false model attribution by request alone. Latest opening full-tier failure remains unresolved with cause unestablished; do not conflate reduced policy success with that gate.\n\nVERIFICATION\nRead exact live sources and actual reports, return SHIP/FIX-FIRST/RETHINK under250words with concrete anchors and limitations. Acceptance requires no CAD/model/decoder requests and no connected WebGL canvas for fresh reduced startup; plain window.__telemetry exists via eager scrollStore and does not itself establish a mounted canvas.\n\nREASONING: low\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
