d `glCanvasCount`/`threeScene` the way the poster cases do, so \"no connected WebGL canvas\" is code-inferred plus zero-request evidence rather than directly observed — that's why browser acceptance is pending, not failed. The opening full-tier failure remains a separate unresolved gate, and this review can't claim a Fable verdict."}}
